0,Sepik Iwam language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sepik_Iwam_language,"Sepik Iwam, or Yawenian, is a language of Papua New Guinea. It is the lexical basis of the Hauna trade pidgin.","Iwam, Sepik",Sepik
